{2}│{R}{1}⦿ Pull otter images from the registry{R}           {2}│{R}
{2}├────────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Usage:{R}                                        {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter reg pl        [options] [image...]{R}      {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter registry pull [options] [image...]{R}      {2}│{R}
{2}├────────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Examples:{R}                                     {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter reg pl fedora{R}                           {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter reg pl --force -a{R}                       {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter registry pull --all{R}                     {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter registry pull --all --force{R}             {2}│{R}
{2}├────────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Options:{R}                                      {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {4}--all{R}     {2}┆{R} {4}-a{R}  {5}Pull all missing enabled images{R}{2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {4}--force{R}   {2}┆{R} {4}-f{R}  {5}Force the operation{R}            {2}│{R}
{2}├────────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Extras:{R}                                       {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {4}--root{R}    {2}┆{R} {4}-r{R}  {5}Use rootful containers{R}         {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {4}--help{R}    {2}┆{R} {4}-h{R}  {5}Show this help message{R}         {2}│{R}
{2}├────────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Notes:{R}                                        {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}{5}Reliable disabled images use vendor fallbacks.{R}  {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}{5}Unreliable ones are reported as unavailable.{R}    {2}│{R}
{2}├────────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
